@SeinServices.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5114
@DeskBuddyDeviceKey = REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_DEVICE_KEY

### DeskBuddy - 텍스트 질문과 표정 응답
POST {{SeinServices.Api_HostAddress}}/api/deskbuddy/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Key: {{DeskBuddyDeviceKey}}

{
  "message": "오늘 인천 날씨 어때~?"
}

